  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your body is capable of regulating itself to thoroughly acclimatize to your present conditions. Whenever your Climate Adaptation would let you adapt to a new climate, you compare its terrain and surroundings to an agamidan heritage that lists an Acclimator terrain. You gain the effects of that agamidan heritage.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">If you have a heritage that lists a different Acclimator terrain, you temporarily lose the effects of your original heritage as you gain the benefits of the new one, but if the terrain you’re adapting to matches your original Acclimator terrain, you increase its listed resistance to be equal to your level.</span></p>"
